===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|fr|omelette}}, from {{m|fr|alemette}}, from {{m|fr|alemelle||knife blade}}, probably derived from {{m|fr|lemelle|la lemelle}}, from {{uder|en|la|lamella||thin plate}}.

